legs of my chair.

391
00:25:12.553 --> 00:25:13.513
And my master's back too.

392
00:25:13.721 --> 00:25:14.764
Let's take him to Tiwari's hospital.

393
00:25:14.764 --> 00:25:18.726
Not him. He charges too much money.

394
00:25:18.726 --> 00:25:21.604
